WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.502
-Welcome to "Late Night,"
everybody.

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.836
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:06.039
How's everybody doing?
All right.

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:08.575
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.977
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:15.348
I mean, those of us
who still can.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:16.615
Fox News announced today

00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:18.985
that it has parted ways
with host Tucker Carlson,

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:20.586
and last Friday
was his final show,

00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:23.055
which is great
but also unsettling,

00:00:23.055 --> 00:00:25.725
at least when he had a show,
we knew where he was.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:28.828
It's creepy trying
to fall asleep

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.963
with a ventriloquist dummy
in your room,

00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:32.932
but it's way creepier
when you wake up

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.935
and it's not there anymore.

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:37.837
"Huh, that's weird.

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:40.873
Oh, my God, is it behind me?"

00:00:40.873 --> 00:00:44.143
Also today, CNN parted ways
with anchor Don Lemon

00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:46.312
amid accusations
of sexist behavior.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:49.348
Wow, does anybody have
an opening for a sexist?

00:00:49.348 --> 00:00:50.383
Oh, right.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.587
So that would...

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:56.022
President Biden is reportedly

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:58.024
preparing to formally announce

00:00:58.024 --> 00:00:59.158
he is running for re-election.

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:02.061
If successful, he will be
the oldest man.

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:04.463
That's it, just the oldest --

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:06.332
just the oldest man.

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:07.433
That's right.

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:08.601
President Biden
is reportedly planning

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:10.235
to formally announce
his re-election campaign

00:01:10.235 --> 00:01:11.304
as early as this week,

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:12.338
which is frankly a little crazy.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:14.106
He's gonna be 82.

00:01:14.106 --> 00:01:15.741
I think you should stop
running for president

00:01:15.741 --> 00:01:20.112
when people start saying
"young" after your age.

00:01:20.112 --> 00:01:23.816
Joe here, 82 years young.

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:27.486
Not only that, the leader of the
free world, that's pretty nuts.

00:01:27.486 --> 00:01:29.789
President Biden met today
with three Tennessee lawmakers

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:32.525
who led gun safety protests
at the state capitol.

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:35.562
Meanwhile, Ron DeSantis
met with the guns.

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:38.397
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.397 --> 00:01:41.033
Senate Judiciary Chair
Dick Durbin, in a new interview,

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:44.036
called for a code of conduct
for Supreme Court justices,

00:01:44.036 --> 00:01:49.742
because right now, the only rule
is no front flips off the yacht.

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:51.377
New Jersey Governor Phil Murphy

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.746
recently declared
that September 23rd

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:57.082
will be Bruce Springsteen Day,
as opposed to Jersey's previous

00:01:57.082 --> 00:02:01.520
Springsteen Day -- all of them.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:03.155
McDonald's has announced
it will offer

00:02:03.155 --> 00:02:06.592
its Big Mac sauce on the side
for dipping or, what the hell,

00:02:06.592 --> 00:02:07.727
soaking.

00:02:09.962 --> 00:02:12.198
New York officials
unveiled a plan today

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:14.700
to install 10 miles of bike
lanes throughout the city.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:15.902
That story again --

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:18.104
New York officials
are adding 10 more miles

00:02:18.104 --> 00:02:20.540
of sometimes car lanes.

00:02:23.075 --> 00:02:24.744
IKEA announced plans last week

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:27.213
to open up eight more stores
across the U.S.

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:29.382
or more likely will start
to build them,

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:33.219
get frustrated, and give up.

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:34.687
According to a new study --

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:37.190
We've all done that,
we've all done it.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.058
According to a new study,
Americans over 50

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:40.760
who play video games
feel overlooked

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.195
by the gaming industry.

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:44.897
For example, there is no option
to play "Grand Theft Auto"

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:49.536
with your left blinker
on the whole time.

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:51.504
That's right,
70% of older Americans

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:53.339
who play video games
do not feel like products

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:54.640
are designed with them in mind,

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:57.376
because when they tried it,
they failed miserably.

00:02:57.376 --> 00:03:01.014
[ Crowd murmurs ]

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:04.783
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.783 --> 00:03:07.520
And that's sadly because you
can't ever predict

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:11.290
the future was our final joke
of the monologue.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.358
You try you usually try
to close on a banger

00:03:13.358 --> 00:03:15.495
and sometimes you close
on one that goes like that.

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:17.363
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:18.531
It doesn't matter, though,

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:19.732
because we've got a great show
for you tonight!

